      "title": "Exact dimension of the space satisfying every coordinate sum",
      "anchor": "global-rank-sums",
      "statement": "On each orbit of H^f acting freely on a finite set, functions with all coordinate sums zero have dimension (|H|−1)^f. For H=F_T^× this gives d_ram(T−1)^f=d_full(T−2)^f.",
